14)=936. So, that's correct.\n\nTherefore, the answer is 936 minutes. So, I think that's solid. All different ways of approaching it give the same answer, so I feel confident.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe fog bank will cover the whole city in \\boxed{936} minutes.\n</think>\n\nThe problem requires determining how long it will take", "model_answer": 936.0, "ground_truth": 936.0, "is_correct": true}
