els per 14 seconds.\n5. **Residual heat**: A quarter of the final 14 seconds' popped kernels pop, which is \\(100 / 4 = 25\\).\n\nAdding all these together:\n\\[\n50 + 150 + 200 + 100 + 25 = 525\n\\]\n\nThus, the total number of pieces of popcorn Daphne has to eat is \\(\\boxed{525}\\).", "model_answer": 525.0, "ground_truth": 525.0, "is_correct": true}
