ater used:\n\\[\n117 + 132 + 3 = 252 \\text{ grams}\n\\]\n\nSubtracting the total water used from the initial amount of water:\n\\[\n330 - 252 = 78 \\text{ grams}\n\\]\n\nThe number of grams of water left is \\(\\boxed{78}\\).", "model_answer": 78.0, "ground_truth": 78.0, "is_correct": true}
