uiz is as follows:\n\n- **Geography questions**: 40% of the total questions, which is \\(40\\% \\times 100 = 40\\) questions.\n- **History and Chemistry questions**: The remaining 60 questions are equally divided between history and chemistry, resulting in \\(60 \\div 2 = 30\\) questions each.\n\nIsabella's performance on each subject is as follows:\n- **Geography**: She is sure to get 70% of the geography questions correct. Calculating this, we get \\(0.70 \\times 40 = 28\\) correct answers.\n- **History and Chemistry**: She is sure to get half of the history and chemistry questions correct. The total number of history and chemistry questions is \\(30 + 30 = 60\\). Half of these questions are correct, which is \\(60 \\div 2 = 30\\) correct answers.\n\nAdding the correct answers from both geography and the combined history and chemistry questions, we get:\n\\[ 28 + 30 = 58 \\]\n\nThus, Isabella is sure to get \\(\\boxed{58}\\) points.", "model_answer": 58.0, "ground_truth": 58.0, "is_correct": true}
