\[\n   15 \\text{ (geography)} + 10 \\text{ (history and biology)} = 25 \\text{ correct answers}\n   \\]\n\nAssuming each question is worth 1 point, Rania is sure to get 25 points.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{25}\n\\]", "model_answer": 25.0, "ground_truth": 25.0, "is_correct": true}
