et me check once again. Maybe the problem is in another way. For example, maybe \"1/8 of the literature and geography questions\" is 1/8 of the total number of questions that are not geometry. Wait, but the rest are equally divided as literature and geography. So, the rest is 24, split into 12 each. So, literature and geography each are 12. So, 1/8 of each would be 1.5, which is impossible", "model_answer": 1.5, "ground_truth": 21.0, "is_correct": false}
