ree days:**\n   \\[\n   114 + 358 + 456\n   \\]\n\n3. **Break down the addition step-by-step:**\n   - First, add Friday and Saturday's pears:\n     \\[\n     114 + 358 = 472\n     \\]\n   - Then, add Sunday's pears to the result:\n     \\[\n     472 + 456 = 928\n     \\]\n\n4. **Verification by vertical addition:**\n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n    114 \\\\\n   +358 \\\\\n   +456 \\\\\n   \\hline\n    928 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\nThe total number of pears Alejandro has is \\(\\boxed{928}\\).", "model_answer": 928.0, "ground_truth": 928.0, "is_correct": true}
