.75 \\text{ hours} \\]\n\nConverting the remaining time into 15-minute episodes:\n\\[ 0.75 \\text{ hours} = 0.25x \\]\n\\[ 0.25x = 0.75 \\]\n\\[ x = \\frac{0.75}{0.25} = 3 \\]\n\nThus, the number of 15-minute episodes Santiago watched on Monday is \\(\\boxed{3}\\).", "model_answer": 3.0, "ground_truth": 3.0, "is_correct": true}
