\n1975 \\text{ (daily target)} - 1750 \\text{ (consumed)} = 225 \\text{ calories remaining}\n\\]\n\nTo find the number of ounces corresponding to the remaining calories:\n\\[\n\\frac{225 \\text{ calories}}{4.5 \\text{ calories per ounce}} = 50 \\text{ ounces}\n\\]\n\nThus, the number of ounces you can eat daily is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{50}\n\\]", "model_answer": 50.0, "ground_truth": 50.0, "is_correct": true}
