ories to ounces:**\n   - Ouncles that can be eaten: \\( \\frac{1250 \\text{ calories}}{10 \\text{ calories per ounce}} = 125 \\text{ ounces} \\).\n\nThus, the maximum number of ounces you can eat is \\(\\boxed{125}\\).", "model_answer": 125.0, "ground_truth": 125.0, "is_correct": true}
