leria responds to 80 emails each day. Over a 4-day work week, the total number of emails she responds to is:\n\n\\[\n80 \\times 4 = 320\n\\]\n\nThus, Valeria responds to \\boxed{320} emails in a 4 day work week.", "model_answer": 4.0, "ground_truth": 320.0, "is_correct": false}
