00 + 630 = 730 \\text{ rooms}\n\\]\n\nThe total number of unoccupied rooms is the total capacity minus the occupied rooms:\n\n\\[\n800 - 730 = 70 \\text{ rooms}\n\\]\n\nThus, the total number of unoccupied rooms in the medical center after 3 weeks is \\boxed{70}.", "model_answer": 70.0, "ground_truth": 70.0, "is_correct": true}
