0.08 - 28.08 = 32.00 \\text{ dollars}\n   \\]\n\n**Answer:** Mateo has \\(\\boxed{32.00}\\) dollars left after buying the anchors.", "model_answer": 32.0, "ground_truth": 32.0, "is_correct": true}
