rews} \\times \\$0.14/\\text{screw} = \\$7.14\n   \\]\n\n2. **Subtract the total cost from the amount she has:**\n   \\[\n   \\$66.14 - \\$7.14 = \\$59.00\n   \\]\n\n**Answer:** Kimia has \\boxed{59.00} dollars left after buying the screws.", "model_answer": 59.0, "ground_truth": 59.0, "is_correct": true}
