ignatures in the remaining 4 weeks.\n</think>\n\nAnanya and Olivia have collected 30 and 59 signatures respectively after 6 weeks. To find the total number of signatures they have collected together, we add these amounts:\n\n\\[\n30 + 59 = 89\n\\]\n\nThey want to have a total of 105 signatures by the end of the fall break. The number of additional signatures they need to collect is the difference between their current total and the goal:\n\n\\[\n105 - 89 = 16\n\\]\n\nThus, the sisters need to collect \\boxed{16} signatures in the remaining 4 weeks.", "model_answer": 4.0, "ground_truth": 16.0, "is_correct": false}
