fair, and the parent association is covering a fifth of the total cost. The total cost of the science fair is 650 euros. \n\nFirst, we calculate a fifth of 650 euros:\n\\[\n\\frac{650}{5} = 130 \\text{ euros}\n\\]\n\nThe parent association covers 130 euros. Therefore, the remaining amount that Yusuf needs to cover is:\n\\[\n650 - 130 = 520 \\text{ euros}\n\\]\n\nYusuf has 135 euros. The amount he is missing is:\n\\[\n520 - 135 = 385 \\text{ euros}\n\\]\n\nThus, Yusuf is missing \\boxed{385} euros.", "model_answer": 385.0, "ground_truth": 385.0, "is_correct": true}
