\n   \\]\n\n3. Cost for scones: \n   \\[\n   5 \\text{ dozen} \\times 113 \\text{ dollars per dozen} = 565 \\text{ dollars}\n   \\]\n\nAdding these amounts together:\n\\[\n13 + 395 + 565 = 973\n\\]\n\nThe total cost was \\(\\boxed{973}\\) dollars.", "model_answer": 973.0, "ground_truth": 973.0, "is_correct": true}
