ing these amounts together to find the total cost:\n\\[\n112 + 510 + 684 = 1306\n\\]\n\nThe total cost was \\(\\boxed{1306}\\) dollars.", "model_answer": 1306.0, "ground_truth": 1306.0, "is_correct": true}
