ia's daily consumption**: Three times Liam's consumption, which is \\(3 \\times 3 = 9\\) servings.\n3. **Combined daily consumption**: \\(3 + 9 = 12\\) servings.\n\nSince the pie has 12 servings and they consume 12 servings per day, the pie will last exactly one day.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1}\n\\]", "model_answer": 1.0, "ground_truth": 1.0, "is_correct": true}
