er day, so it's 8 per day. So, yeah, 2 days. Alright, confident with that answer.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe pizza will last for \\boxed{2} days.\n</think>\n\nRoya can eat 4 pieces of pizza per day. Mei can eat twice as much as Roya, which means Mei can eat \\(4 \\times 2 = 8\\) pieces per day. Together, they eat \\(4 + 8 = 12\\) pieces of pizza each day. Since the pizza has 24 pieces, the number of days it will last is \\(24 \\div 12 = 2\\).\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2}\n\\]", "model_answer": 2.0, "ground_truth": 2.0, "is_correct": true}
