culate the total cost for 6 loaves of bread:**\n   \\[\n   6 \\text{ loaves} \\times ¥8/\\text{loaf} = ¥48\n   \\]\n\n2. **Calculate the total cost for 5 bagels:**\n   \\[\n   5 \\text{ bagels} \\times ¥4/\\text{bagel} = ¥20\n   \\]\n\n3. **Find the difference in cost:**\n   \\[\n   ¥48 - ¥20 = ¥28\n   \\]\n\n**Answer:** The bread costs \\boxed{28} yen more than 5 bagels.", "model_answer": 5.0, "ground_truth": 28.0, "is_correct": false}
