\n\nTo determine how much more 9 loaves of bread cost than 7 croissants, we first calculate the total cost for each item.\n\n- The cost of 9 loaves of bread is calculated as:\n  \\[\n  9 \\times 5 = 45 \\text{ euros}\n  \\]\n- The cost of 7 croissants is calculated as:\n  \\[\n  7 \\times 1 = 7 \\text{ euros}\n  \\]\n\nNext, we find the difference between the two totals:\n\\[\n45 - 7 = 38 \\text{ euros}\n\\]\n\nThus, the loaves of bread cost \\boxed{38} euros more than the croissants.", "model_answer": 38.0, "ground_truth": 38.0, "is_correct": true}
